  <diagram id="reuse-plan-flowthrough-f03-future-distance" name="Cache-line access schedule and circular reuse distance" ecgTitle="Cache-line access schedule and circular reuse distance" ecgDescription="A horizontal schedule follows property line 0x80000040 from current outer vertex 8 to subsequent access-source vertices 11 and 15. The ReusePlan stores their quantized epochs, and rrip_first consults the nearer circular distance only after the line becomes RRIP eligible.">
